# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (`—`, U+2014) anywhere: UI copy, catalog strings, comments, commit messages, event titles, docs, or chat replies.

## Use instead
- Colon (preferred for event titles): `Coachella Weekend 1: Day 1`, `ADÉLA: The Red Bottoms Tour`
- Comma or period to break a sentence
- Parentheses for asides
- Do not use hyphens as title separators either (`Name - Day 1`); use `Name: Day 1`

```text
❌ Coachella Weekend 1 — Day 1
❌ Coachella Weekend 1 - Day 1
✅ Coachella Weekend 1: Day 1

❌ Fixed images — now from 2025 press
✅ Fixed images: now from 2025 press
```

If you see an existing em dash while editing, replace it in the same pass.
